  "id": "short-firnas",
  "title": "The leap, held lightly",
  "note": "Abbas ibn Firnas is said to have glided from a height in Cordoba, a story the house holds lightly for its late written record.",
  "short": true,
  "chapters": [
    {
      "id": "the-short",
      "title": "The leap, held lightly",
      "theme": "nutvoid",
      "short": true,
      "beats": [
        {
          "kind": "plate",
          "plate": "a-winged-figure-gliding-from-a-height",
          "hold": 50.2,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "A man tried to fly six centuries early",
              "sub": "six hundred years before Leonardo's wings",
              "size": "hook",
              "at": 0.0,
              "until": 6.89
            },
            {
              "text": "Cordoba, about 810 to 887",
              "sub": "an inventor named Abbas ibn Firnas leaps",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 7.23,
              "until": 13.09
            },
            {
              "text": "He builds wings of silk and feathers",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 13.43,
              "until": 17.04
            },
            {
              "text": "He leaps from a height before a crowd",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 17.38,
              "until": 21.11
            },
            {
              "text": "He glides some distance through the air",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 21.45,
              "until": 25.26
            },
            {
              "text": "Then he lands hard, hurting his back",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 25.6,
              "until": 29.21
            },
            {
              "text": "Only a rival's joke survives from his time",
              "sub": "the full tale was written centuries later",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 29.55,
              "until": 36.76
            },
            {
              "text": "A rival's joke is not a flight log",
              "sub": "a poet mocked him for flying like a bird",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 37.1,
              "until": 43.81
            },
            {
              "eyebrow": "Abbas ibn Firnas, Cordoba",
              "text": "We hold this story lightly, not proven",
              "src": "Al-Maqqari's account, about 700 years later",
              "size": "h1",
              "at": 44.15,
              "until": 49.83
            }
